    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>Like many among your Species, you know how to blend in with galactic society, using your natural gregarious disposition to keep others off guard.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sullustan\" title=\"Sullustan\">Sullustan</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;Whenever you successfully use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Change_Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Change Attitude\">Change Attitude</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> Skill to change a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a>, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> checks against that target for the next 24 hours.</p>",
